  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>This is a list of all the <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">missions</a> and primary quests in <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Nightfall\" title=\"Guild Wars Nightfall\">Guild Wars Nightfall</a>, taking you through the <a href=\"/wiki/Storyline\" title=\"Storyline\">storyline</a>, as well as the <a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_mission\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Challenge mission\">challenge missions</a>. Characters from non-Nightfall campaigns who travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elona</a> will join the storyline at <a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan\" title=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan\">Kamadan, Jewel of Istan</a> with the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Preparations\" title=\"Battle Preparations\">Battle Preparations</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Storyline_missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Storyline missions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Istan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Istan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Kourna\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Kourna</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Vabbi\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vabbi</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#The_Desolation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Desolation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Realm_of_Torment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Realm of Torment</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Challenge_missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge missions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Elite_mission\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elite mission</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Storyline_missions\">Storyline missions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Nightfall_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Storyline missions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Istan\"><a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Nightfall_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Istan\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Either</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Rally_the_Recruits_(Tutorial)\" title=\"Rally the Recruits (Tutorial)\">Rally the Recruits (Tutorial)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Into_Chahbek_Village\" title=\"Into Chahbek Village\">Into Chahbek Village</a></dd>\n<dt>Or</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Take_the_Shortcut_(Skip_Tutorial)\" title=\"Take the Shortcut (Skip Tutorial)\">Take the Shortcut (Skip Tutorial)</a></dd>\n<dt>1. <a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village\" title=\"Chahbek Village\">Chahbek Village</a> <small>(Required hero: <a href=\"/wiki/Koss\" title=\"Koss\">Koss</a>)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Primary_Training\" title=\"Primary Training\">Primary Training</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Honing_your_Skills\" title=\"Honing your Skills\">Honing your Skills</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_Training\" title=\"Secondary Training\">Secondary Training</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Choose_Your_Secondary_Profession_(Nightfall)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Choose Your Secondary Profession (Nightfall)\">Choose Your Secondary Profession</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Leaving_a_Legacy\" title=\"Leaving a Legacy\">Leaving a Legacy</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Honorable_General\" title=\"The Honorable General\">The Honorable General</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Signs_and_Portents\" title=\"Signs and Portents\">Signs and Portents</a></dd>\n<dt>2. <a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings\">Jokanur Diggings</a> <small>(Required hero: <a href=\"/wiki/Melonni\" title=\"Melonni\">Melonni</a>)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Isle_of_the_Dead_(quest)\" title=\"Isle of the Dead (quest)\">Isle of the Dead</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Bad_Tide_Rising\" title=\"Bad Tide Rising\">Bad Tide Rising</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Special_Delivery\" title=\"Special Delivery\">Special Delivery</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Big_News,_Small_Package\" title=\"Big News, Small Package\">Big News, Small Package</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Following_the_Trail\" title=\"Following the Trail\">Following the Trail</a></dd>\n<dt>3. <a href=\"/wiki/Blacktide_Den\" title=\"Blacktide Den\">Blacktide Den</a> <small>(Required hero: <a href=\"/wiki/Tahlkora\" title=\"Tahlkora\">Tahlkora</a>)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/The_Iron_Truth\" title=\"The Iron Truth\">The Iron Truth</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Trial_by_Fire\" title=\"Trial by Fire\">Trial by Fire</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/War_Preparations_(Ghost_Reconnaissance)\" title=\"War Preparations (Ghost Reconnaissance)\">War Preparations (Ghost Reconnaissance)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/War_Preparations_(Recruit_Training)\" title=\"War Preparations (Recruit Training)\">War Preparations (Recruit Training)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/War_Preparations_(Wind_and_Water)\" title=\"War Preparations (Wind and Water)\">War Preparations (Wind and Water)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Time_is_Nigh\" title=\"The Time is Nigh\">The Time is Nigh</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><i>Characters from other campaigns will begin here and follow this quest chain:</i>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Preparations\" title=\"Battle Preparations\">Battle Preparations</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Securing_Champion%27s_Dawn\" title=\"Securing Champion&#39;s Dawn\">Securing Champion's Dawn</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/A_Land_of_Heroes\" title=\"A Land of Heroes\">A Land of Heroes</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Time_is_Nigh\" title=\"The Time is Nigh\">The Time is Nigh</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Kourna\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Nightfall_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Kourna\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>4. <a href=\"/wiki/Consulate_Docks\" title=\"Consulate Docks\">Consulate Docks</a> <small>(Required hero: <a href=\"/wiki/Dunkoro\" title=\"Dunkoro\">Dunkoro</a>)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Hunted!\" title=\"Hunted!\">Hunted!</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Escape\" title=\"The Great Escape\">The Great Escape</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/And_a_Hero_Shall_Lead_Them\" title=\"And a Hero Shall Lead Them\">And a Hero Shall Lead Them</a></dd>\n<dt>5. <a href=\"/wiki/Venta_Cemetery\" title=\"Venta Cemetery\">Venta Cemetery</a> <small>(Required hero: Koss)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/The_Council_is_Called\" title=\"The Council is Called\">The Council is Called</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/To_Vabbi!\" title=\"To Vabbi!\">To Vabbi!</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Centaur_Blackmail\" title=\"Centaur Blackmail\">Centaur Blackmail</a></dd>\n<dt>6. <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads\">Kodonur Crossroads</a> <small>(Required hero: <a href=\"/wiki/Zhed_Shadowhoof\" title=\"Zhed Shadowhoof\">Zhed Shadowhoof</a>)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Message_(Nightfall_quest)\" title=\"Mysterious Message (Nightfall quest)\">Mysterious Message</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/21px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/32px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/42px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>The storyline divides in two paths here, depending on whether you choose <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Master_of_Whispers\" title=\"Master of Whispers\">Master of Whispers</a>. These paths are <b>mutually exclusive</b>, so you can only get one of the heroes (at this time). If you wish to do the other mission (not quest), you can finish the campaign, or join a party that contains the other hero.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Either</dt>\n<dd>(<a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/For_a_Price\" title=\"For a Price\">For a Price</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/No_Me,_No_Kormir\" title=\"No Me, No Kormir\">No Me, No Kormir</a>\n<dl><dt>7a. <a href=\"/wiki/Pogahn_Passage\" title=\"Pogahn Passage\">Pogahn Passage</a> <small>(Required hero: Margrid the Sly)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Or</dt>\n<dd>(<a href=\"/wiki/Master_of_Whispers\" title=\"Master of Whispers\">Master of Whispers</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/Secrets_in_the_Shadow\" title=\"Secrets in the Shadow\">Secrets in the Shadow</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/To_Kill_a_Demon\" title=\"To Kill a Demon\">To Kill a Demon</a>\n<dl><dt>7b. <a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge\">Rilohn Refuge</a> <small>(Required hero: Master of Whispers)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>Storyline rejoins for...</i>\n<dl><dt>8. <a href=\"/wiki/Moddok_Crevice\" title=\"Moddok Crevice\">Moddok Crevice</a> <small>(Required hero: Dunkoro)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vabbi\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Nightfall_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Vabbi\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Rally_The_Princes\" title=\"Rally The Princes\">Rally The Princes</a></dd>\n<dt>9. <a href=\"/wiki/Tihark_Orchard\" title=\"Tihark Orchard\">Tihark Orchard</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/All%27s_Well_That_Ends_Well\" title=\"All&#39;s Well That Ends Well\">All's Well That Ends Well</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Warning_Kehanni\" title=\"Warning Kehanni\">Warning Kehanni</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/21px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/32px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/42px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>Once again, the storyline divides in two possible paths, depending on which hero you chose in the previous fork, Margrid the Sly or Master of Whispers.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Either</dt>\n<dd>(Margrid the Sly) <a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a>\n<dl><dt>10a. <a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule\">Dasha Vestibule</a> <small>(Required hero: Margrid the Sly)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Or</dt>\n<dd>(Master of Whispers) <a href=\"/wiki/Calling_the_Order\" title=\"Calling the Order\">Calling the Order</a>\n<dl><dt>10b. <a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion\">Dzagonur Bastion</a> <small>(Required hero: Master of Whispers)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>Storyline rejoins for...</i>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Pledge_of_the_Merchant_Princes\" title=\"Pledge of the Merchant Princes\">Pledge of the Merchant Princes</a></dd>\n<dt>11. <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh</a> <small>(Required hero: Tahlkora)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_at_the_Kodash\" title=\"Attack at the Kodash\">Attack at the Kodash</a> <small>(Required heroes: Koss and Melonni)</small></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/21px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/32px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/42px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This is the third fork in the storyline, as the player is presented with two possible paths, depending on whether you choose to defend the village of Ronjok in Kourna or help the Vabbians with the Nightfallen Garden of Seborhin. Note that these are <b>not</b> mutually exclusive, both can be completed, but only one is needed to continue the storyline. Nundu Bay is considered easier.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Either</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Garden_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger</a>\n<dl><dt>12a. <a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde\">Jennur's Horde</a> <small>(Required hero: Koss)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Or</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Ronjok_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Ronjok in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Ronjok in Danger</a>\n<dl><dt>12b. <a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay\" title=\"Nundu Bay\">Nundu Bay</a> <small>(Required hero: Melonni)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>Storyline rejoins for...</i>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Crossing_the_Desolation\" title=\"Crossing the Desolation\">Crossing the Desolation</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Desolation\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation\" title=\"The Desolation\">The Desolation</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Nightfall_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: The Desolation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>13. <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Desolation\" title=\"Gate of Desolation\">Gate of Desolation</a> <small>(Required hero: Zhed Shadowhoof)</small></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/A_Deal%27s_a_Deal\" title=\"A Deal&#39;s a Deal\">A Deal's a Deal</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Horde_of_Darkness\" title=\"Horde of Darkness\">Horde of Darkness</a></dd>\n<dt>14. <a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Morah\" title=\"Ruins of Morah\">Ruins of Morah</a> <small>(Required hero: <a href=\"/wiki/General_Morgahn\" title=\"General Morgahn\">General Morgahn</a>)</small></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Realm_of_Torment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Nightfall_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Realm of Torment\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Uncharted_Territory\" title=\"Uncharted Territory\">Uncharted Territory</a></dd>\n<dt>15. <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Pain\" tit